<title>SPAIN: Madrid stock exchange normal after bomb scare.</title>
<headline>Madrid stock exchange normal after bomb scare.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Operators at the Madrid stock exchange returned to work after a bomb threat forced them to evacuate the building and interrupted trading in some small, marginal stocks, witnesses said.</p>
<p>Police with bomb-sniffing dogs searched the exchange in central Madrid after a bomb threat was phoned in but found no explosives.</p>
<p>Screen-based trading was unaffected by the scare.</p>
</text>
